 //
 // Upper bound of SMEM item indices accepted by the stub.  DALSYSDxe asks for
@@ -207,6 +209,276 @@ SmemStubFunc3 (
   @retval EFI_SUCCESS  The protocol was installed.
   @return              Status of InstallMultipleProtocolInterfaces().
